msgid "Copy destination tag"
msgstr "Copier le destination tag"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:269
msgid "Without this tag we cannot match the payment to your order."
msgstr "Sans ce destination tag, nous ne pouvons pas associer le paiement à votre commande."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:273
msgid "Token and issuer"
msgstr "Jeton et émetteur"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:276
msgid "Copy issuer"
msgstr "Copier l'émetteur"

#. translators: %s: the token symbol (RLUSD, USDC)
#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:279
#, php-format
msgid "Only %s from exactly this issuer is credited. Your wallet needs a trust line for it."
msgstr "Seuls les %s de cet émetteur précis sont crédités. Votre portefeuille a besoin d'une trustline pour cela."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:285
msgid "Paying from an exchange?"
msgstr "Vous payez depuis une plateforme d'échange ?"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:286
msgid "The destination tag is required, and the amount must still arrive in full after the exchange's fee."
msgstr "Le destination tag est obligatoire, et le montant doit arriver en entier après déduction des frais de la plateforme."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:290
msgid "Pay with a wallet"
msgstr "Payer avec un portefeuille"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:292
msgid "Scan with a wallet app"
msgstr "Scanner avec une application de portefeuille"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:292
msgid "Show QR code ▾"
msgstr "Afficher le code QR ▾"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:295
msgid "QR code with address, destination tag and amount"
msgstr "Code QR avec adresse, destination tag et montant"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:296
msgid "Expired – please request a new amount"
msgstr "Expiré – veuillez demander un nouveau montant"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:298
msgid "Scan with Xaman. Address, destination tag and amount are filled in, and Xaman offers to switch to the Xahau network if it is set to another one – please check them before sending."
msgstr "Scannez avec Xaman. L'adresse, le destination tag et le montant sont préremplis, et Xaman propose de passer au réseau Xahau s'il est réglé sur un autre – veuillez les vérifier avant l'envoi."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:298
msgid "Scan with Xaman or another XRPL wallet. Address, destination tag and amount are filled in – please check them before sending."
msgstr "Scannez avec Xaman ou un autre portefeuille XRPL. L'adresse, le destination tag et le montant sont préremplis – veuillez les vérifier avant l'envoi."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:303
msgid "or"
msgstr "ou"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:307
msgid "Pay with a browser wallet"
msgstr "Payer avec un portefeuille de navigateur"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:310
msgid "Looking for wallets …"
msgstr "Recherche de portefeuilles …"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:312
msgid "No browser wallet found. Use the QR code or copy the details."
msgstr "Aucun portefeuille de navigateur trouvé. Utilisez le code QR ou copiez les informations."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:313
msgid "The wallet fills in the payment. You confirm it there."
msgstr "Le portefeuille remplit le paiement. Vous le confirmez dans le portefeuille."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:317
msgid "Open in wallet app"
msgstr "Ouvrir dans l'application de portefeuille"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:320
msgid "found"
msgstr "trouvé"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:321
msgid "Confirm in your wallet …"
msgstr "Confirmez dans votre portefeuille …"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:322
msgid "Sent – we are checking for it."
msgstr "Envoyé – nous vérifions la réception."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:323
msgid "The wallet does not respond. Is the extension installed and unlocked?"
msgstr "Le portefeuille ne répond pas. L'extension est-elle installée et déverrouillée ?"

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:324
msgid "The connection to the wallet failed – please try again."
msgstr "La connexion au portefeuille a échoué – veuillez réessayer."

#. translators: %network% is replaced by the script with the network's name
#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:326
msgid "Your wallet is set to another network. Please switch to %network%."
msgstr "Votre portefeuille est réglé sur un autre réseau. Veuillez passer à %network%."

#: includes/views/ledger-direct_html.php:327
msgid "The payment through the wallet failed. Please use the QR code or copy the details."
msgstr "Le paiement via le portefeuille a échoué. Veuillez utiliser le code QR ou copier les informations."

